          },
          {
            "word": "Well",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "健康的，良好的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Officials from Greenwich Observatory have the clock checked twice a day.",
      "translation": "格林威治天文台的官员每天两次检查这口钟的准确性。",
      "startTime": 60.35,
      "endTime": 67.16,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "On the B.B.C. you can hear the clock when it is actually striking because microphones are connected to the clock tower.",
      "translation": "你可以在英国广播公司的节目中听到这口钟的声音，因为麦克风连接着钟楼。",
      "startTime": 67.17,
      "endTime": 77.46,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
